+
+## P1-02 FormBridge hardening
+
+专项覆盖：
+
+```text
+original field moved into component
+form="" ownership
+Portal popup 内 button
+nested component
+reset
+submit
+programmatic setValue
+native input/change
+multiple values
+disabled/readOnly
+destroy restore authored field
+form 生命周期中被移动
