+## P1-06 Diagnostics 与 verify 结合
+
+除了资源数量，还要能作为 CI contract：
+
+```text
+create → destroy 后必须 balanced
+open → close 后 blocking refs balanced
+async cancel 后 pending = 0
+observer attach/detach balanced
+```
