+
+## P1-07 InteractionDetails 统一 lifecycle reason contract
+
+现有：
+
+```text
+reason
+source
+originalEvent
+trigger
+currentTarget
+cancel()
+allowPropagation()
+stopPropagation()
+```
+
+继续统一到：
+
+```text
+OverlayRuntime
+DismissableLayer
+TriggerInteraction
